  <instance id="UCD_CBR_Cycle_ProjectCase #11" >
    <att name="SystemName" value="Car Maintenance" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Car Maintenance system facilitates the process of vehicle repair and upkeep. Customers initiate requests for maintenance, potentially filing insurance claims and making payments. Mechanics perform the maintenance work, sometimes requiring parts to be ordered and shipped. The Service Center manages activities, delivers cars, receives payments, and handles part logistics. The system also includes invoice generation and activity monitoring." />
