    <att name="Description" value="The Bank system facilitates financial transactions and account management for Customers, supported by Bank Employees. Customers can Deposit Funds, Withdraw Funds, and Open Accounts. Bank Employees Proivde Service to customers. Both Deposit and Withdraw operations include an Update Balance function to maintain accurate account records." />
