    <att name="Description" value="The Trading System facilitates deal capture, price display, risk analysis, account updates, and limit setting. Traders interact with the system to capture deals, view prices, and analyze risks. The Trading Manager sets limits within the system. The Accounting System interacts with the system to update accounts." />
