    <att name="Description" value="The Game system manages a leaderboard and game settings. Game Administrators can edit, update, and modify settings, while Players can view, play the game, and modify settings. Viewing the leaderboard includes fetching the leaderboard data. Playing the game automatically updates the leaderboard." />
