  <instance id="UCD_CBR_Cycle_ProjectCase #23" >
    <att name="SystemName" value="Healthcare" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Healthcare system manages patient care processes, from initial complaint recording and admission through assessment, treatment, progress reporting, and eventual discharge. Administrative Clerks record initial complaints, while Guardians and Patients participate in the admission process. Nurses and Doctors assess patient status and advise medical treatment. The system also handles legal authorization and discharge procedures, involving review of summaries and recommendations." />
