  <instance id="UCD_CBR_Cycle_ProjectCase #24" >
    <att name="SystemName" value="Coffin Escape System" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Coffin Escape System facilitates a stunt performance where an Escape Artist attempts to escape from a coffin. The system involves a Coffin Maker who ensures the coffin's quality, a Safety Officer and the Escape Artist who collaborate to minimize risks, and an Audience whose excitement is a key consideration. Computer control can be optionally enabled to assist with fluid pumping during the stunt. The system relies on pumping fluids and ensuring sufficient air within the coffin for the stunt to be performed." />
