  <instance id="UCD_CBR_Cycle_ProjectCase #28" >
    <att name="SystemName" value="Restaurant" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Restaurant system facilitates the ordering, preparation, serving, and payment for food. Clients order food through a Waiter, which initiates the cooking process by the Chef. Once cooked, the Waiter serves the food, and the Client pays the bill through the Cashier. Serving food always includes paying the bill, cooking food always includes serving food, and ordering food always includes cooking food." />
