    <att name="SystemName" value="Bike Management System" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Bike Management System facilitates the rental and maintenance of bicycles. Administrators manage bike and customer lists, while Supervisors handle bike issuance and returns. The system supports finding bikes, handling customer inquiries, and generating receipts. The system interacts with Administrators for bike list maintenance and with Supervisors for bike handling operations." />
