  <instance id="UCD_CBR_Cycle_ProjectCase #31" >
    <att name="SystemName" value="Multi Plant DCS" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Multi Plant DCS system manages cooling services across multiple plants, involving interactions with Maintenance Operators, Commercial Users, Residential Users, a general User, and a Controller. The Controller manages chiller sequencing and temperature monitoring, while users are alerted to refrigerant leaks. Maintenance Operators provide maintenance services, which can trigger refrigerant leak alerts. Cooling services include monitoring chilled water temperatures. Commercial and Residential Users are specialized types of Users." />
