  <instance id="UCD_CBR_Cycle_ProjectCase #36" >
    <att name="SystemName" value="Inverted Pendulum System" />
    <att name="Description" value="The Inverted Pendulum System is controlled by a User and subject to external Disturbances. The User can start and stop the controller, set the controller gain, and set the amplifier gain. The Disturbance actor introduces external forces to the system, affecting its stability. The system's core functionality revolves around maintaining the pendulum's balance through controller adjustments." />
